N kountry.pkg
D  7 Oct 2026
U 36
d 'KOUNTRY': module to standardize country names across various datasets
d 
d   kountry standardizes names of countries from various datasets.
d For example, the codes 2 (COW code), 111 (IMF), 840 (UN Stats),
d and the names United States of America, U.S.A., USA, U.S., US,
d UNITED STATES, etc., lower or upper case, with or without the
d definite article "the", will all be converted to "United States".
d  The command makes it easier to merge data sets that use
d different codes and names to identify the same countries. The
d command is described in an article in Stata Journal, 8:3, 2008,
d updated in 10:4, 2010.
